{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1437.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ae222def3f42371ffb8c7c6d57b235b03d57c1410a96a898f41e1df316351ed4","ja":"そうね……それじゃあ思い切って、\n別のことをしてみましょうか。","zh":"也是呢……那索性下定决心，\n试着做点别的事情看看吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
